Dear Happy Holidays to Our Colleagues In Service,

Louis Fawcett's 

**RE-IMAGINING NONPROFITS...Turning Your Mess Into a Masterpiece** is
taking charity by storm. Louis is leading the charge to change the way
we do business. He's the President of National Association of Nonprofit
Organizations and Executives (NANOE).

National Development Institute's Jimmy LaRose says,

**"Louis takes an 'emperor has no clothes' approach to the piety and
crazymaking rampant throughout our sector.**

**RE-IMAGINING NONPROFITS is a page-turner that will have you saying to
yourself, 'YES', 'THANK YOU', 'FINALLY', 'OF COURSE', 'WHY NOT?'"**

Here's a first look at his powerful analysis and mind-bending solutions
that ensure impact organizations grow their important missions.

**Chapter 1 - The Mess We've Inherited**

